			"note": "Literary; namaskaram is what you will hear."},
		"goodbye": {"native": "మళ్ళీ కలుద్దాం",
			"respelling": "MUL-lee kuh-lood-DAAM", "status": "ai",
			"note": "'Let's meet again'; day to day, vus-TAA-nu."},
		"how_are_you": {"native": "మీరు ఎలా ఉన్నారు?",
			"respelling": "MEE-roo eh-LAA oon-NAA-roo",
			"status": "ai"},
		"thank_you": {"native": "ధన్యవాదాలు",
